@startuml Rule Group Delete
title Delete Rule Group Interface Activity Diagram

start

:Receive DELETE /api/rule-groups/{groupId} request;
:Parse path parameters;

:Call RuleGroupService.deleteRuleGroup();

:Query if rule group exists;
if (Rule group does not exist?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 error;
  stop
endif

:Query all rules in rule group;

:Iterate rule list;
:Set rule status to OFFLINE;
:Update RuleEntity;
:Remove rule from rule group;
:Delete RuleGroupRuleRelationEntity;

:Delete RuleGroupEntity;
:Return 200 OK;

stop

@enduml
